	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Numerical variables were mean-imputed and categorical variables were mode-imputed. Categorical predictors were ordinal- or one-hot encoded, and EHRFormer numerical inputs were quantile-binned. The majority class was randomly downsampled to a 1:1 ratio separately in both training and test sets. Exact post-downsampling training and test counts were not explicitly reported. The authors provided a GitHub repository containing the underlying code; the UNOS-derived training and validation datasets were not publicly available.

